        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a wide Escutcheon Plate Classroom Function Lever (Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.   Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" door prep.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>Polished Brass Rim Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Device</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-grade-2-surface-vertical-rod-door-panic-device-th1100edsvtbar\"><b>TH1100EDSVTBAR Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/wide-escutcheon-plate-storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-ew-09-phl\"><b>Storeroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-EW-08-PHL Keyed Classroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429LPEKFH-Handing.pdf?v=1704262244\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-EW-08-PHL Handing Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429LPEKFH.pdf?v=1704262244\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-EW-08-PHL Installation Template & Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
